**Given:**

dfrac{(4.32 times 4.32 - 2.64 times 2.64)}{1.68}

**Formula used:**

(a² - b²) = (a + b)(a - b)

**Calculation:**

dfrac{(4.32 times 4.32 - 2.64 times 2.64)}{1.68}

⇒ dfrac{(4.32 + 2.64)(4.32 - 2.64)}{1.68}

⇒ dfrac{6.96 times 1.68}{1.68}

⇒ 6.96

**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**
